{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Kd6r9sL3cnyE5vwuniE657","type":"tool_result","content":"105:- 1675 Module strategy: real-time strategy and simulation: selection, orders, armies, production, resources, placement, fog, AI; a day clock, needs, overlays (engine/modules/strategy.js); E.Clock: clock, E.Strategy: strategy\n1677:- `new E.Clock(o = {}) → clock` †: new E.Clock({ day: 240 (real seconds of game time a day), hour: 8 (to start at) })\n1678:- `clock.hour` †: the hour (0..23)\n1680:- `clock.light()` †: the light by the hour: { ambient (.12 at night .. 1 at noon), color (the sky's tint: blue night, warm dawn and dusk) }\n1684:- `clock.day = 1` †: the day (1, 2, ...)\n1163:- `new E.Shell(game, o = {}) → shell`: new E.Shell(game, { theme, screens: { name: spec }, settings: { items, onChange(settings, key) }, store: 'shell-settings', meters: .125, standard: true }): an HTML interface over the game (see the section's header)\n1164:- `new E.Shell({ theme })`: CSS variables (ink, paper, accent, muted, danger, line, font, titleFont)\n1165:- `new E.Shell({ screens })`: specs ui.show(name) starts from (the pause screen follows game.paused; screens: { pause: false } leaves it out)\n1166:- `new E.Shell({ settings })`: settings.items: the game's own settings, { key, label, type: 'toggle' | 'slider' | 'select', min, max, step, options, value } (kept in game.settings, beside the standard ones)\n1167:- `new E.Shell({ store, meters })`: store: where an older version saved them; meters: meters per world unit for distances\n1168:- `new E.Shell({ standard })`: false leaves out the standard menu (the pause screen's Settings, Controls, Full screen and Quit, and the settings' groups)\n968:    const coarse = this._touched || (window.matchMedia && matchMedia('(pointer: coarse)').matches);   // (a laptop with a touch screen: once touched)\n2539:    if (!this.input._touched && !(window.matchMedia && matchMedia('(pointer: coarse)').matches)) return false;\n2572:    const touch = I._touched || !!(this._coarse || (this._coarse = window.matchMedia && matchMedia('(pointer: coarse)')) || {}).matches;   // (the query kept: this runs every frame)\n3204:    device: [N.hardwareConcurrency && N.hardwareConcurrency + ' cores', N.deviceMemory && N.deviceMemory + ' GB', mm('(pointer: coarse)') ? 'touch' : W ? 'mouse' : ''].filter(Boolean).join(' · ')\n9395:    const S = this._game.settings, coarse = window.matchMedia && matchMedia('(any-pointer: coarse)').matches, touch = I._touchArgs && (coarse || I._touched || S.touch === 'on');\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174740__x7ef5ea/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5176bdbd-8f33-407b-b89e-9fc1c745933d","uuid":"69814c14-5706-4539-bcd4-d6ea9d1e121c","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:01:19.074Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"105:- 1675 Module strategy: real-time strategy and simulation: selection, orders, armies, production, resources, placement, fog, AI; a day clock, needs, overlays (engine/modules/strategy.js); E.Clock: clock, E.Strategy: strategy\n1677:- `new E.Clock(o = {}) → clock` †: new E.Clock({ day: 240 (real seconds of game time a day), hour: 8 (to start at) })\n1678:- `clock.hour` †: the hour (0..23)\n1680:- `clock.light()` †: the light by the hour: { ambient (.12 at night .. 1 at noon), color (the sky's tint: blue night, warm dawn and dusk) }\n1684:- `clock.day = 1` †: the day (1, 2, ...)\n1163:- `new E.Shell(game, o = {}) → shell`: new E.Shell(game, { theme, screens: { name: spec }, settings: { items, onChange(settings, key) }, store: 'shell-settings', meters: .125, standard: true }): an HTML interface over the game (see the section's header)\n1164:- `new E.Shell({ theme })`: CSS variables (ink, paper, accent, muted, danger, line, font, titleFont)\n1165:- `new E.Shell({ screens })`: specs ui.show(name) starts from (the pause screen follows game.paused; screens: { pause: false } leaves it