{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018aBYX1xPvaHhDtTs4W4C5i","type":"tool_result","content":"618\t  - Bottom left: context prompts.\n619\t  - Bottom right: pickup toasts.\n620\t  - Centre: Notion, Room, Level and Quest popups (queued, 2.5 s each).\n621\t  - Siege: the Banner HP bar and the wave label. Boss: a big HP bar with the name, phase pips and a \"TANGLED!\" flash.\n622\t  - **Fades:** the HUD fades to 30% when idle for 6 s outside combat. Hold ○ for HUD-less screenshots? No: keep it simple and leave this out.\n623\t- **Title:**"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5176bdbd-8f33-407b-b89e-9fc1c745933d","uuid":"c2dc2d5d-c3ea-461d-9681-3f4c4399c121","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:42:17.263Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174740__x7ef5ea/work/PLAN.md","content":"  - Bottom left: context prompts.\n  - Bottom right: pickup toasts.\n  - Centre: Notion, Room, Level and Quest popups (queued, 2.5 s each).\n  - Siege: the Banner HP bar and the wave label. Boss: a big HP bar with the name, phase pips and a \"TANGLED!\" flash.\n  - **Fades:** the HUD fades to 30% when idle for 6 s outside combat. Hold ○ for HUD-less screenshots? No: keep it simple and leave this out.\n- **Title:**","numLines":6,"startLine":618,"totalLines":1602}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_018aBYX1xPvaHhDtTs4W4C5i","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
