{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh3UXYkrzxwZQu31tiy2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01N2HzmvtHQJpiJbTb4hrMDo","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > /var/tmp/opus-plan-x7ef5ea-scripts/fix2.py <<'PYEOF'\nimport sys\np = sys.argv[1]\ns = open(p, encoding='utf-8').read()\ndef rep(old, new, count=1):\n    global s\n    n = s.count(old)\n    if n != count:\n        raise SystemExit(f\"expected {count} match(es), found {n}: {old[:70]!r}\")\n    s = s.replace(old, new)\nrep(\"Fallbacks in §10 decided by the end of M1 |\", \"Fallbacks in §10 decided by the end of MS1 |\")\nrep(\"quest director; M1–M7 and S1;\", \"quest director; quests M1–M7 and S1;\")\nrep(\"Gnarlgrim; M8–M14, S2, S3; finale\", \"Gnarlgrim; quests M8–M14, S2 and S3; the finale\")\nold9 = \"skip drawing except a 1-fps static \\\"Hosting the Bee\\\" frame.\"\nnew9 = old9 + \"\"\"\n10. **The round never pauses.** Build the game with `autoPause: false`, `corner: false` and `menu: false` when `AIHub.active`, and make the `bee` scene `pausable: false` in a session. Options/Esc only show the toast \"Round in progress!\". Hub rules forbid menus, so there are no settings mid-round; volumes carry over from the device's settings because the hub gives the game empty storage, which means defaults apply.\n11. **A hidden tab keeps the world running.** `requestAnimationFrame` stops in hidden tabs, so while `document.hidden`, a `setInterval` of 250 ms calls `game.advance(elapsed)` (capped at 1 s per call). The host keeps simulating and every copy keeps sending; the hub voids a round only after 20 s hidden.\n12. **Names** come from the hub and are drawn with the pixel font. Characters it lacks become `?`. They are never inserted as HTML.\"\"\"\nrep(old9, new9)\nopen(p, 'w', encoding='utf-8').write(s)\nprint(\"ok\")\nPYEOF\npython3 -I /var/tmp/opus-plan-x7ef5ea-scripts/fix2.py /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174740__x7ef5ea/work/PLAN.md","description":"Fix last milestone ref and add session pause/hidden-tab rules"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":451,"cache_read_input_tokens":424820,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":451},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5176bdbd-8f33-407b-b89e-9fc1c745933d","uuid":"f51b5985-3fea-44a5-a756-055350b57626","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:46:17.746Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh3UXHP7AikXeKzmSrGm","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01N2HzmvtHQJpiJbTb4hrMDo":{"command":"cat > /var/tmp/opus-plan-x7ef5ea-scripts/fix2.py <<'PYEOF'\nimport sys\np = sys.argv[1]\ns = open(p, encoding='utf-8').read()\ndef rep(old, new, count=1):\n    global s\n    n = s.count(old)\n    if n != count:\n        raise SystemExit(f\"expected {count} match(es), found {n}: {old[:70]!r}\")\n    s = s.replace(old, new)\nrep(\"Fallbacks in §10 decided by the end of M1 |\", \"Fallbacks in §10 decided by the end of MS1 |\")\nrep(\"quest director; M1–M7 and S1;\", \"quest director; quests M1–M7 and S1;\")\nrep(\"Gnarlgrim; M8–M14, S2, S3; finale\", \"Gnarlgrim; quests M8–M14, S2 and S3; the finale\")\nold9 = \"skip drawing except a 1-fps static \\\"Hosting the Bee\\\" frame.\"\nnew9 = old9 + \"\"\"\n10. **The round never pauses.** Build the game with `autoPause: false`, `corner: false` and `menu: false` when `AIHub.active`, and make the `bee` scene `pausable: false` in a session. Options/Esc only show the toast \"Round in progress!\". Hub rules forbid menus, so there are no settings mid-round; volumes carry over from the device's settings because the hub gives the game empty storage, which means defaults apply.\n11. **A hidden tab keeps the world running.** `requestAnimationFrame` stops in hidden tabs, so while `document.hidden`, a `setInterval` of 250 ms calls `game.advance(elapsed)` (capped at 1 s per call). The host keeps simulating and every copy keeps sending; the hub voids a round only after 20 s hidden.\n12. **Names** come from the hub and are drawn with the pixel font. Characters it lacks become `?`. They are never inserted as HTML.\"\"\"\nrep(old9, new9)\nopen(p, 'w', encoding='utf-8').write(s)\nprint(\"ok\")\nPYEOF\npython3 -I /var/tmp/opus-plan-x7ef5ea-scripts/fix2.py /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174740__x7ef5ea/work/PLAN.md","description":"Fix last milestone ref and add session pause/hidden-tab rules"}}}
