{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MxmVuXr4VTUKtquhfwPcAq","type":"tool_result","content":"ok\n# Dragon Quilt Builders\n\n*A build plan for an original block-building action RPG inspired by Dragon Quest Builders.*\n...\nugrep: error: error at position 24\n(?mi)TODO\\|TBD\\|FIXME\\|\\? no\\b\\|xxx\n                        \\___empty (sub)expression\n\n\n--- section headers:\n9:## 0. At a glance\n41:## 1. Title selection\n56:## 2. Design pillars\n66:## 3. Deliverables, folder layout, commands\n113:## 4. Tech stack\n115:### 4.1 Stack\n124:### 4.2 Engine changes (keep a list; it goes into the About screen and the exit interview)\n137:## 5. Architecture\n139:### 5.1 Principles\n151:### 5.2 Modules (`src/`, concatenated in this order)\n197:### 5.3 Game object and scenes\n246:## 6. Systems\n248:### 6.1 Voxel world (the riskiest system; built first, see §9 MS1)\n322:### 6.2 Camera and views\n332:### 6.3 The Builder (player)\n364:### 6.4 Input, controls, prompts (controller first, keyboard and mouse native)\n430:### 6.5 Items, bag, hotbar, chests\n437:### 6.6 Crafting, stations, Notions\n452:### 6.7 Objects\n473:### 6.8 Rooms (`DQ.Rooms`)\n497:### 6.9 Town: Banner, border, Cheer, levels, Patterns (`DQ.Town`)\n517:### 6.10 Residents (`DQ.Residents`)\n552:### 6.11 Monsters and combat (`DQ.Monsters`, `DQ.Combat`)\n570:### 6.12 Siege and bosses (`DQ.Siege`, `DQ.Bosses`)\n600:### 6.13 Day, night, lighting, weather (`DQ.Clock`)\n609:### 6.14 Health and hunger\n615:### 6.15 Story, quests, dialog, cutscenes (`DQ.Quests`, `DQ.Cutscenes`)\n634:### 6.16 UI screens and HUD (10-foot, controller first; `DQ.Hud`, `DQ.Menus`)\n668:### 6.17 Audio (`DQ.AudioX`)\n697:### 6.18 Save and load (`DQ.Save`)\n714:### 6.19 Dev mode (`DQ.Dev`, from the pause menu → \"Dev Tools\")\n756:### 6.20 Attract mode (`DQ.Attract`)\n775:### 6.21 Multiplayer: AI Hub sessions and the Quilting Bee (`DQ.Net`, `DQ.Bee`)\n856:### 6.22 Touch-only devices\n864:### 6.23 Settings and accessibility (additions to the standard Settings)\n880:### 6.24 About/Credits screen and exit interview\n913:### 6.25 Autopilot: the shared AI (`DQ.Autopilot`)\n935:## 7. Content\n937:### 7.1 The world: the Patchwork Realm around Thimbleton (144 × 144 columns, 24 levels, seed 20261103)\n992:### 7.2 Blocks (`DQ.BLOCKS`)\n1020:### 7.3 Items and materials (`DQ.ITEMS`)\n1065:### 7.4 Recipes (`DQ.RECIPES`: station, inputs → output, notion trigger)\n1103:### 7.5 Objects (`DQ.OBJECTS`; each has an `E.SHAPES` entry, sized for the 26-unit hero)\n1127:### 7.6 Rooms (`DQ.ROOMS`, checked in this priority order)\n1139:### 7.7 Town levels (`DQ.LEVELS`)\n1154:### 7.8 Characters\n1170:### 7.9 Monsters (`DQ.MONSTERS`; speeds in units/s, aggro in blocks)\n1190:### 7.10 Story and quests: \"Chapter One: A Stitch in Time\"\n1355:### 7.11 Music (`DQ.SONGS`; original compositions, engine step format)\n1396:### 7.12 Sound effects (`DQ.SFX`, engine voices; all from code)\n1418:## 8. Art direction and animation\n1422:### 8.1 Block textures (16×16 texels per face, 1 texel ≈ 1 world unit)\n1454:### 8.2 World dressing\n1462:### 8.3 Characters and monsters\n1478:### 8.4 UI look\n1485:### 8.5 Effects\n1497:### 8.6 Animation (engine-native rigs plus new moves)\n1534:## 9. Build order and milestones\n1557:## 10. Risks and de-risking\n1575:## 11. Testing plan\n1582:### 11.1 Harness\n1593:### 11.2 Headless suites (what each checks)\n1622:### 11.3 Browser suites (`--browser`; Playwright, pinned in `engine/package.json`)\n1643:### 11.4 Manual passes (short, recorded in DEVLOG)\n1650:### 11.5 Asset checks\n1656:## 12. Definition of done (check every line before handing off)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5176bdbd-8f33-407b-b89e-9fc1c745933d","uuid":"83cd9649-2f03-4951-95e4-9096c62013d3","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:49:43.329Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"ok\n# Dragon Quilt Builders\n\n*A build plan for an original block-building action RPG inspired by Dragon Quest Builders