{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017jAcsv8yaanxzAghGRkESD","type":"tool_result","content":"1658:- [ ] Everything in §6 and §7 is implemented; there are **no TODOs, placeholders or stubbed features** (`grep -rn \"TODO\\|FIXME\\|placeholder\" src/` is empty).\n---\n    eye: false,                 // Builder's Eye held\n    cursor: null | { x, y, z }, // an explicit target cell (mouse pick, Builder's Eye, AI)\n    camTurn: 0 | -1 | 1, zoom: 0 | -1 | 1 }\n  ```\n\n...\n### 6.25 Autopilot: the shared AI (`DQ.Autopilot`)\nThe attract mode, the scripted playthrough test, the Bee bots and cutscene NPC walks all use one task runner. It emits **intents** (§6.4), so the AI plays throu\n- **Setup:** `const ap = new DQ.Autopilot(ctx, builder, { cheats: { god, teleport, infinite, fastPlace }, ui: true })`. Each task is a `game.script` generator; \n- **Tasks:**\n\n  | Task | What it does |\n  |---|---|\n  | `walkTo(x, y, z, { radius = 1 })` | Paths with `DQ.Nav` and steers along it, hopping on step-ups. With `cheats.teleport`, a path longer than 40 blocks, or o\n  | `face(x, y)` | Turns the builder toward a point |\n  | `breakAt(x, y, z)` | Walks into reach, sets `intent.cursor` and swings until the block is gone |\n  | `placeAt(x, y, z, item, rot)` | Walks into reach, selects the hotbar slot (it adds the item to the hotbar if needed) and places |\n  | `buildStamp(stamp, origin, { rate })` | Places a stamp's cells bottom-up, near to far, never trapping itself (it stands outside the footprint) |\n  | `craft(recipeId, n)` | With `ui: true`, walks to the station, interacts and drives the crafting screen through MENU actions; with `ui: false`, calls `Crafti\n  | `talk(npcId, choices = [])` | Walks to the NPC, interacts, confirms pages, and picks choices by index |\n  | `fight({ filter, spin = true })` | Approaches the nearest match, combos, uses a Spin Stitch when 2 or more are within 2 blocks, and backs off on a wind-up t\n  | `manBallista(id, target)` | Mounts the ballista, aims and fires until the target is Tangled or dead |\n  | `wait(s)`, `until(fn, timeout)` | Waits |\n\n- **Failure:** every task has a timeout (walk 30 s, break 8 s, craft 10 s, fight 60 s) and fails with an `apFail` event `{ task, reason, at }`. Tests assert the\n- **Cheats** are applied by the Autopilot before the task: `god` sets the dev god flag, `infinite` tops up the bag, `fastPlace` sets the place cooldown to 0.15 \n\n---\ntotal 184\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 micha micha   4096 Nov  3 18:46 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 micha micha   4096 Nov  3 17:48 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 159748 Nov  3 18:49 PLAN.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha    680 Nov  3 17:47 STAGE.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha   8756 Nov  3 17:47 TASK.md","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5176bdbd-8f33-407b-b89e-9fc1c745933d","uuid":"59407695-746f-4da4-ab35-f53ad02c4cc0","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:49:47.546Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"1658:- [ ] Everything in §6 and §7 is implemented; there are **no TODOs, placeholders or stubbed features** (`grep -rn \"TODO\\|FIXME\\|placeholder\" src/` is empty).\n---\n    eye: false,                 // Builder's Eye held\n    cursor: null | { x, y, z }, // an explicit target cell (mouse pick, Builder's Eye, AI)\n    camTurn: 0 | -1 | 1, zoom: 0 | -1 | 1 }\n  ```\n\n...\n### 6.25 Autopilot: the shared AI (`DQ.Autopilot`)\nThe attract mode, the scripted playthrough test, the Bee bots and cutscene NPC walks all use one task runner. It emits **intents** (§6.4), so the AI plays throu\n- **Setup:** `const ap = new DQ.Autopilot(ctx, builder, { cheats: { god, teleport, infinite, fastPlace }, ui: true })`. Each task is a `game.script` generator; \n- **Tasks:**\n\n  | Task | What it does |\n  |---|---|\n  | `walkTo(x, y, z, { radius = 1 })` | Paths with `DQ.Nav` and steers along it, hopping on step-ups. With `cheats.teleport`, a path longer than 40 blocks, or o\n  | `face(x, y)` | Turns the builder toward a point |\n  | `breakAt(x, y, z)` | Walks into reach, sets `intent.cursor` and swings until the block is gone |\n  | `placeAt(x, y, z, item, rot)` | Walks into reach, selects the hotbar slot (it adds the item to the hotbar if needed) and places |\n  | `buildStamp(stamp, origin, { rate })` | Places a stamp's cells bottom-up, near to far, never trapping itself (it stands outside the footprint) |\n  | `craft(recipeId, n)` | With `ui: true`, walks to the station, interacts and drives the crafting screen through MENU actions; with `ui: false`, calls `Crafti\n  | `talk(npcId, choices = [])` | Walks to the NPC, interacts, confirms pages, and picks choices by index |\n  | `fight({ filter, spin = true })` | Approaches the nearest match, combos, uses a Spin Stitch when 2 or more are within 2 blocks, and backs off on a wind-up t\n  | `manBallista(id, target)` | Mounts the ballista, aims and fires until the target is Tangled or dead |\n  | `wait(s)`, `until(fn, timeout)` | Waits |\n\n- **Failure:** every task has a timeout (walk 30 s, break 8 s, craft 10 s, fight 60 s) and fails with an `apFail` event `{ task, reason, at }`. Tests assert the\n- **Cheats** are applied by the Autopilot before the task: `god` sets the dev god flag, `infinite` tops up the bag, `fastPlace` sets the place cooldown to 0.15 \n\n---\ntotal 184\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 micha micha   4096 Nov  3 18:46 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 micha micha   4096 Nov  3 17:48 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 159748 Nov  3 18:49 PLAN.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha    680 Nov  3 17:47 STAGE.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha   8756 Nov  3 17:47 TASK.md","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_017jAcsv8yaanxzAghGRkESD","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
